---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Freelance Contract Template | usignpdf"
  seo={{
    page_description: "A free, comprehensive freelance contract template to protect your business.",
    canonical_url: "https://usignpdf.com/templates/freelance-contract/"
  }}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose max-w-none">
    <a href="/templates" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Templates</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Freelance Contract Template</h1>

    <p>Before you write a single line of code or design a single pixel, you need a contract. Read our full guide on <a href="/blog/how-to-write-freelance-contract">how to write a freelance contract that protects you</a>.</p>

    <div class="bg-surface-alt p-6 border border-border rounded my-8 flex justify-between items-center not-prose">
        <span class="font-bold">Freelance Independent Contractor Agreement (PDF)</span>
        <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent text-surface rounded hover:bg-accent-hover font-semibold">Download PDF</a>
    </div>

    <h2>Are electronic freelance contracts legal?</h2>
    <p>Yes. Under laws like the <a href="/legality/us-esign-act">US ESIGN Act</a> and <a href="/legality/eu-eidas">EU eIDAS</a>, electronic signatures are completely legally binding for B2B contracts. A digital <a href="/security/audit-trails">Audit Trail</a> is often stronger evidence in court than a forged wet signature.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
